      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2016-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(x=-2016<0,\\) we have \\(|x|=2016.\\) Thus \\[ \\begin{aligned} |x|-x&=2016-(-2016) \\\\ &=4032, \\end{aligned} \\] so the innermost absolute value is \\(4032.\\) Therefore the full expression is \\[|4032-2016|+2016=4032.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D .",
      "hints": [
        "For \\(x<0\\), \\(|x|=-x\\)",
        "Evaluate the absolute values from the inside outward"
      ],
